logs, environment snapshots and figures, that is to everything under
`experiments/*/results/`, `experiments/*/figures/`, `experiments/*/env/`,
`experiments/*/data/` and the `experiment_log.json` files. The full text is at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode and a summary at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ — see LICENSE-DATA.md.

Prose files (`README.md`, `plan.md`, `report_validation.md`, the per-experiment
`README.md`) are also CC BY 4.0.

